  "limitations": [
    "Formalizes only the balance_exceeds_reserve impact; credited_unspent and drain impacts are out of scope for this plan.",
    "The relation is stated as the absence of the reported state (balance exceeding reserve) rather than as an equality, because the report only asserts the inequality direction.",
    "Attacker authorization is not modeled; the impact is a state condition independent of caller identity.",
    "Formalizes only the credited_unspent impact; drain and balance_exceeds_reserve are not covered by this plan.",
    "amount_actually_sent is a symbolic observable; no concrete value is bound.",
    "The relation is stated at the amount level; the balance.sub(reserve) computation is treated as the credited amountIn observable.",
    "Drain is formalized as a qualitative Boolean outcome because no numeric magnitude is reported.",
    "The fee-consistency intent is used as the selected security intent; the amountIn-actual intent is not formalized in this pass.",
    "Only the drain impact is formalized; other impacts are handled in separate passes."
  ]
